<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">neural-stun</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Neural Stun</ansi> spell overloads the target's nervous system with a
surge of psionic force, leaving them momentarily stunned and unable
to act. A stunned target is completely vulnerable — the ideal setup
for a killing blow.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast neural-stun [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 8
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower and constitution resist the stun
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Stun — target is incapacitated for a brief time

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
